            <section id="bio">
                <h1>Aaron Grando</h1>
                <h2>Technologist, engineer, creative agency veteran</h2>
                <p>
                    I’ve spent the last <%= (Time.now.year-2010).humanize %> years at <a href="https://rtop.com/" target="_blank">RTO+P</a>, serving as the agency's Technology Director since 2017.   
                    We’ve done a lot of great work, pitched a lot of ideas, wrote a lot of code, and launched a lot of websites. I’ve enjoyed 
                    working with a huge variety clients, from rag-tag popups to some of the world's biggest brands.
                </p> 
                <p>
                    Lately, I’ve been working on applying AI to create novel creative experiences for brands, and applying my deep experience managing 
                    brand web presences to the new digital realities.
                </p>
            </section>
